thorised visitors.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715110650\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1863/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30720/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7390/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930774/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.931      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   47.931      1 -total\n 53.81%   25.789      8 Template:Icon_text\n 47.36%   22.701     19 Template:Trim\n 19.50%    9.348      2 Template:Uid\n 16.21%    7.770      3 Template:Icon_link\n 13.91%    6.666      1 Template:Main_only\n 11.60%    5.560      2 Template:CharLink\n 11.21%    5.374      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.88%    5.213      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:44098-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715110650 and revision id 225460. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}